        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782903664208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Web technology : Tools, technology, services, programing language,\nwhich is used to design or create a webpages is known as web \ntechnologies.\n\nWebsites : collection of miltiple webpages under a single domain.\n              is known as a website.\nWebpages : single html document is known as webpages.\n\nBrowser : It is a software or tool through which we can access \nthe websites.\n\nWeb/WWW : collection of websites.\n\n          3 Tiers of architecture / full stack architecture\n\nFrontent               Backend                Database\n\nhtml               java + spring + python      sql      mysql oracle\ncss                + dyjango + nodejs +\njavascript        expressjs                       no-sql     mongoDB\n\nreact.js ,          c,c++,php,ruby,perl etc...\nVue.js\n\nsingle page application",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Web technology : Tools, technology, services, programing language,\nwhich is used to design or create a webpages is known as web \ntechnologies.\n\nWebsites : collection of miltiple webpages under a single domain.\n              is known as a website.\nWebpages : single html document is known as webpages.\n\nBrowser : It is a software or tool through which we can access \nthe websites.\n\nWeb/WWW : collection of websites.\n\n          3 Tiers of architecture / full stack architecture\n\nFrontent               Backend                Database\n\nhtml               java + spring + python      sql      mysql oracle\ncss                + dyjango + nodejs +\njavascript        expressjs                       no-sql     mongoDB\n\nreact.js ,          c,c++,php,ruby,perl etc...\nVue.js\n\nsingle page application",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
