      "updated": 1789618728990,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "XML : Xtensible markup language. It is used to store and transport\nthe tag. It stores the data of inside tags. In XML tag can be user\ndefined as well as pre-defined (polog).  >>   (filename.xml).\n\nWhat is HTML ?\n* Hyper text makeup language.\n* It is used for creating structure in our websites.\n* It is used for adding content in our websites.\n* It is developed by Tim Berners Lie.\n\nDifferent version of HTML :        HTML1 --> 1991 / 1993\n                                          HTML2 --> 1995\n                                          HTML3 --> 1997\n                                          HTML4 --> 1999\n                                          HTML5 --> 2014",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "XML : Xtensible markup language. It is used to store and transport\nthe tag. It stores the data of inside tags. In XML tag can be user\ndefined as well as pre-defined (polog).  >>   (filename.xml).\n\nWhat is HTML ?\n* Hyper text makeup language.\n* It is used for creating structure in our websites.\n* It is used for adding content in our websites.\n* It is developed by Tim Berners Lie.\n\nDifferent version of HTML :        HTML1 --> 1991 / 1993\n                                          HTML2 --> 1995\n                                          HTML3 --> 1997\n                                          HTML4 --> 1999\n                                          HTML5 --> 2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
