      "updated": 1782903555128,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Types of Website : \nStatic : Those website whose content will be same for all\nthe users, is known as static website.\nex : portfolio website, landing page etc...\nDynamic : Those website whose content change with respect \nto user, is known as dynamic website.\nex : instagram, facebook, youtube etc....",
